      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA GOSSIP (8) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 10 lengths fifth (18.27) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 300m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Given another chance. JUNGLE WAY (2) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Maiden winner (17.65) three back at this track. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Key player on best and worth another try. QUEEN LOCH (7) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 300m behind Ivy Star (18.37) in a Grade 5. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Can measure up this time. BIG BOY CHEVY (6) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
